R1 is released. R2 has seven developed, source-routed, preserved product bodies and the actual product section, with same-runtime corrections and executable checks. Its independent review remains explicit; full shared-field/transverse dispositions are R3, full eight-station/48-movement semantic/envelope review is R4, and fresh cold review is R5. The existing R3–R6 tickets remain their execution route. They have not been replaced by this packet or by a new generic approval gate.

T26/#27 remains Frank's ratification of the actual refined whole and common writing base. This R2 batch is not such a proposed final base. No sovereign-manuscript prose or independent model-writing branch is created.
